title AMUS29 — Constel lease: a lease read, safe under a bounded clock
prompt recur the loop — keep taking the next agent-doable Lindy-first crux-first lap, self-approve the design round, send each increment as its own signed round, stop at custody gates
think After AMUS28 (depart) shipped, the next pure crux on the Constel ladder before the gated socket rung: AMUS20 proved the read-index (always safe, one round-trip per read). Raft §6.4.1's leader lease is the fast alternative, and its safety hinges on one exact inequality — a genuine crux, not padding.
think Modeled the clock as a bounded monotonic u64 tick (no wall clock, no real time), so the rung stays purely local. grant gates on tenure.still_commands (composing AMUS24); lease_sound holds span < election_timeout; serve_on_lease requires both sound AND unexpired, else the caller falls back to the read-index.
think The crux the read-index never needed: a lease used past the election timeout could let a partitioned leader still believe its lease valid while the majority elected a successor — a stale read. Proved directly: an unsound lease (span == timeout) is refused even at elapsed 0.
obs GREEN on the first build across six blocks: minority leader refused NoMajority; soundness inequality exact (9<10 sound, 10 and 11 unsound); the crux — unsound lease never served even unexpired; sound unexpired served, expired falls back, boundary exact at elapsed == span; monotonic u64 near 4e9 never underflows at now == granted; bounded over a full roster.
obs TAME bans clean; lease.rye carries ≥2 asserts/fn. Purely local — no socket, no network, no keys, no funds, no real address; custody gate #2 and gate #4 untouched. The read-side companion to AMUS24 CheckQuorum.
loom witness=amus_lease_witness wall_blocks=6 build=first_green
file constel/lease.rye AMUS29 — grant + lease_sound + serve_on_lease, the leader-lease read over tenure + the read-index fallback
file tools/amus_lease_witness.rish the on-metal witness — builds, runs selftest, asserts the GREEN amus-lease line
file active-designing/20260814-081032_amus29-constel-lease-read.md the self-approved design capture for the round
